    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Meteorite...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly did Jessica see...? Were you with her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's better if you don't find out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has nothing to do with our combat operations... so don't worry about it right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long are you going to keep hiding, Rhodes Island insects?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(...! Mephisto! Did he find us?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Don't make any noises. Not yet. It's just another one of his tricks.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aww, still don't feel like coming out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't think I didn't see your reinforcements coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, whatever. I have something to show you. I'm sure you'll like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking back now... We were originally planning to take over Chernobog from the very beginning...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "We waited for so, so long... and finally our time has come...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "The moment when we take our revenge against Ursus! Against those who persecuted us Infected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, what about the fellows in this sub-city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "bg_0_guard",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "image": "bg_0_guard",
        "xScaleTo": 1.3,
        "yScaleTo": 1.3,
        "duration": 20
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "They ran away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "They had pretty quick reactions. Ran away before we had a chance to take action.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Disconnected themselves, and took off as quickly as they could--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But where did they hope to escape to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Our comrades had long permeated every district, waiting for our opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, we caught up to them, and gave them the punishment they deserved.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "These cowards, these perpetrators; what were we to do with them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's simple - we would make an example of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "A proclamation that all injustices against the Infected would be purged...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes, that is the symbol of the Reunion Movement...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let them all turn into effigies of terror, one by one!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, set that nearby effigy on fire! Let there be light!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yessir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, light up this entire city! Let Rhodes Island see what happens to all of these cowardly oppressors!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
