        "duration": 10
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Why... Why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jessica, calm down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "--That bastard!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This is too atrocious...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "The smell of burning flesh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "... ...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long to you intend to keep hiding, my dear rabbit of Chernobog?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw your little rabble sneaking around earlier, so I thought you might've been up to something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But turns out, you're just here to enjoy the show... How boring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you brought an entire party with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you do all this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without using some terror tactics, how else were we supposed to minimize the losses?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make an example out of these ten percent...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and the other ninety percent fall into line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "This, you see, can be considered the best way of saving lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am not the same person I was back then..",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though you might not remember...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... Back then, I was timid, fragile, and easily scared... I couldn't move forward without you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might even look the same way right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the difference is, I've now seen more than enough tragedies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to see something like this happen ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But nothing will change unless I face reality!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, I have to remind myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't afford to retreat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to continue to fight on!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
